    "name": "Demo – Fake bike shop (online scam)",
    "description": "Fictional and deliberately short scenario (10 entities) made for demonstration. People, organization, domains (`.example`), IP (documentation range), phone number (range reserved for fiction by the French regulator ARCEP) and wallet are made up.\n\nA victim paid for a bike that was never delivered, on a short-lived online shop. Two chains of pivots converge on a suspect:\n\n1. domain, then historical WHOIS, then email, then forum profile;\n2. the website's company name, then the company register, then its director.\n\nThe link between the wallet and the suspect remains to be established.",
